    ExportService ==>|GeM XML Spec| GeM
    ExportService ==>|Beckn Protocol| ONDC
    ExportService ==>|B2C Payload| Karigar
    ExportService ==>|Bulk Contract| B2B

    GeM -.->|Display QR Tag| ScanQR
    ONDC -.->|Display QR Tag| ScanQR
    Karigar -.->|Display QR Tag| ScanQR
    B2B -.->|Display QR Tag| ScanQR

    WebPortal <==>|Public Verification API| API

